       <dl>
        <dt><u>Description</u></dt>
        <dd style="padding-bottom: 5px;"><i>Distributed cracking with a few cm down to SE across many cracks.  Photo 186 view NW, photo 187 view SW.  Fault zone here is at least 75 meters wide and consists of 3 primary faults with zones of cracking in between each fault.  Zones of cracking continues across ridge to the NW, however the majority of the displacement appears to be along the SE side of ridge.</i></dd>
