       <dl>
        <dt><u>Description</u></dt>
        <dd style="padding-bottom: 5px;"><i>Distributed cracking and moletrack along SE side of low ridge.  Moletrack cracks up to 50 cm deep.  Main fault here appears to be constrained to a ~10 m wide zone with some cracking distributed NW of main trace on linear ridge.  Some moletrack pop ups have uphill facing scarps ~5 cm high.  Cracks also observed on NW side of ridge between stations 15 and 16.</i></dd>
