           <span class="popuptext" id="myPopup"><p align="center"><b><u>Team Members</u></b><br/>M. DeFrisco/CGS<br/>B. Haddon/USGS<br/>J. Hernandez/CGS<br/>K. Hudnut/USGS<br/>B. Olson/CGS<br/>G. Seitz/CGS<br/>E. Spangler/CGS</p></span>
          </div>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="text-align: left;"><strong>Date: </strong><i>July 6, 2019 at 2:34:00 PM PDT</i></td>
          <td style="text-align: right;"><strong>Observer Location: </strong><i>At Site</i></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="text-align: left; padding-bottom: 5px;"><strong>Inferred Origin:</strong><i> Tectonic</i></td>
          <td style="text-align: right; padding-bottom: 5px;"><strong>Inferred Source Event:</strong> <i>M7.1</i></td>
        </tr>
       </table>
       <table>
        <tr>
        	<th>Rupture/Deformation Characteristics</th>
        </tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Fault Expression: </strong><i>Crack(s)</i></td></tr>
        <tr><td style="padding-bottom: 5px;">
       <dl>
        <dt><u>Description</u></dt>
        <dd style="padding-bottom: 5px;"><i>Large crack with right-lateral. Four linear offsets of painted lines due to double yellow. Yellow line north has 31-31.5 cm right-lateral. South has 31-33 cm right-lateral.  White line south 10-11 cm.  Vertical is not significant. Up to north less than 1 cm.</i></dd>
       </dl>
      </td></tr>
       </table>
       <table>
        <tr>
