       <dl>
        <dt><u>Description</u></dt>
        <dd style="padding-bottom: 5px;"><i>Right-lateral slip; 18 cm of slip observed on berm on north side of road. In general, fault steps left, but overall nw trend. Some areas of distributed offset, but at nw end, still good fault traces observed at surface. Walked out fault trace for 800 m. </i></dd>
       </dl>
