        <dd style="padding-bottom: 5px;"><i>Rupture crosses road. Trends N20W. Mostly vertical offset, minor left lateral offset, down to west, but there appears to be a graben north of road, 14 +/- 2 cm vertical separation, On another 7-8 cm, Max of 10 cm, min of 5 cm, photo 596, cracks distributed over 10-12 m total </i></dd>
       </dl>
      </td></tr>
