       <dl>
        <dt><u>Description</u></dt>
        <dd style="padding-bottom: 5px;"><i>Right-lateral offset on main trace from old tire tracks, trend of fault at offset N30W, tire tracks trend S20E. Lateral of 42 cm, vertical of 11 cm, maybe up to 13, +/- 1.5 cm? En echelon left steps near tire tracks of 2 m with pervasive fracturing, narrower spacing to south. Eastern margin has single breaks of 8-10 cm for fracturing. </i></dd>
