        <tr><td><strong>Local Fault Strike: </strong><i>159°</i></td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Rupture Width: </strong><i>31 m</i></td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Fault Expression: </strong><i>Zone of deformation</i></td></tr>
        <tr><td style="padding-bottom: 5px;">
       <dl>
        <dt><u>Description</u></dt>
        <dd style="padding-bottom: 5px;"><i>Transect located at northwest end of broad fault splay.  Fault zone width is 31 m, slope of ground outside of fault zone is low (0.1 degrees). Reported vertical slip is based on projection total separation across fault zone, assuming a 0.1 degree slope.  Uncertainty estimate reflects range calculated from different slopes. Discrete offsets are much smaller, totaling 49 cm.</i></dd>
       </dl>
      </td></tr>
