          <td style="text-align: right; padding-bottom: 5px;"><strong>Inferred Source Event:</strong> <i>M7.1</i></td>
        </tr>
       </table>
       <table>
        <tr>
        	<th>Rupture/Deformation Characteristics</th>
        </tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Overall Fault Strike: </strong><i>150° ± 1°</i></td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Rupture Width: </strong><i>3.4 m</i></td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Fault Expression: </strong><i>Scarp</i></td></tr>
        <tr><td style="padding-bottom: 5px;">
       <dl>
        <dt><u>Description</u></dt>
        <dd style="padding-bottom: 5px;"><i>Offset tire tracks across west facing scarp.  Tire tracks have 2 degree variation in trend (fit visually) and are linear up to fault zone. Fault zone width is 3.4 m and measurement aperture is 3.3 m. Horizontal slip (426 m) is mean of two measurements, and uncertainty is 20 cm (larger than variation in individual measurements) reflecting tire width.  Vertical offset is 66 cm when local slope of 0.7 degrees is removed, and 71 cm measured across fault zone.  Vertical uncertainty is 10 cm, based on elevation variation along transect. </i></dd>
       </dl>
      </td></tr>
       </table>
       <table>
        <tr>
        	<th>Slip/Separation Measurements</th>
        </tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Observed Feature: </strong><i>Tire track and fault perpendicular transect</i></td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Measurement Aperture: </strong><i>3.3 m</i></td></tr>
        <tr><td>
          <dl>  
         	 <dt><strong><u>Slip Vector</u></strong></dt>
        	   <dd>
              <strong>Azimuth: </strong><i>150° ± 1°</i></dd>
            </dt>
           </dl>
         </td></tr>
        <tr><td>
          <dl>  
         	 <dt><strong><u>Horizontal Offset</u></strong></dt>
        	   <dd>
        	   <strong>Length: </strong><i>426 ± 20 cm right-lateral</i><br/>
              <strong>Azimuth: </strong><i>150° ± 1°</i></dd>
            </dt>
           </dl>
         </td></tr>
        <tr><td style="padding-bottom: 5px;"><strong>Vertical Separation: </strong><i>68 ± 15 cm west side down</i></td></tr>
       </table>
       <table>
        <tr>
        	<td></td>
        </tr>
       </table>
