        <tr><td style="padding-bottom: 5px;">
       <dl>
        <dt><u>Description</u></dt>
        <dd style="padding-bottom: 5px;"><i>Right-stepping zone of distributed minor faults south of SR-178. Individual displacements appear to be less than 10 cm, local fault trend N12E in en echelon zone, which steps across local mound of tufa toward road. No new cracks in 178 pavement patch. Overall trend N43E.</i></dd>
       </dl>
