       <dl>
        <dt><u>Description</u></dt>
        <dd style="padding-bottom: 5px;"><i>Measurement across north margin of Jeep track.  80 cm left-lateral, locally down to west, about 15 cm vertical, but may be enhanced by it being on edge of a channel margin. Zone of deformation is about 20+ meters wide.  Slip on minor strands difficult to resolve. Principal strain about 1 m wide.  Possible another 20 +/-10 cm on trace ~8 m to the east.</i></dd>
       </dl>
