        <tr><td><strong>Rupture Width: </strong><i>20 m</i></td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Fault Expression: </strong><i>scarp</i></td></tr>
        <tr><td style="padding-bottom: 5px;">
       <dl>
        <dt><u>Description</u></dt>
        <dd style="padding-bottom: 5px;"><i>Reported value based on projection of sand to gravel contact along northern margin of a channel that crosses the fault. Right-lateral offset measurements are 115-153 cm, using two different projections of contact on west side of fault (related to possible bend in channel near fault). Fault azimuth: 135 deg. ~10 cm of right-lateral offset not accounted for about 20 m to east. Net displacement should include this additional offset. DuRoss has sketch of feature. </i></dd>
       </dl>
      </td></tr>
       </table>
       <table>
        <tr>
        	<th>Slip/Separation Measurements</th>
        </tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Observed Feature: </strong><i>Channel margin</i></td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Measurement Aperture: </strong><i>20 m</i></td></tr>
        <tr><td>
          <dl>  
         	 <dt><strong><u>Horizontal Separation</u></strong></dt>
        	   <dd>
        	   <strong>Length: </strong><i>125 – 163 cm right-lateral</i><br/>
            </dt>
           </dl>
         </td></tr>
        <tr><td style="padding-bottom: 5px;"><strong>Vertical Separation: </strong><i>10 ± 5 cm west side down</i></td></tr>
       </table>
       <table>
        <tr>
        	<td></td>
        </tr>
       </table>
         <p style="margin-left: 5px"><strong>Note: </strong><i>Sum of two strands.</i></p>
       <table>
        <tr>
        	<td></td>
        </tr>
       </table>
