       <dl>
        <dt><u>Description</u></dt>
        <dd style="padding-bottom: 5px;"><i>Faulting returns. Broad zone of deformation on steep slope; overall strike 320, 5 main strands, ~50 meters wide. On trace at western edge, C. DuRoss on eastern extent; each strand has approximately 5-10 cm vertical (very approximate), uphill facing scarps in sand. Lateral slip not discernible. </i></dd>
       </dl>
      </td></tr>
