        <tr><td style="padding-bottom: 5px;">
       <dl>
        <dt><u>Description</u></dt>
        <dd style="padding-bottom: 5px;"><i>Easternmost rupture extent in broad (about 75-m wide) zone of deformation. Local fault orient is 150 to N and 195 to S. E. Spangler and A. Pickering collected point for W most extent of rupture zone. No measurable offset. Negligible to few cm of down to W vertical.</i></dd>
       </dl>
      </td></tr>
