        <tr><td style="padding-bottom: 5px;">
       <dl>
        <dt><u>Description</u></dt>
        <dd style="padding-bottom: 5px;"><i>Point on easternmost fault within rupture zone. Approx. 10-20 cm of vertical slip; no obvious lateral. Down to west. Steep slope - scarp could be purely extensional. Rupture is continuous, so likely primary rupure origin.</i></dd>
       </dl>
      </td></tr>
