          <td style="text-align: left;"><strong>Principal Observer: </strong><i>C. DuRoss/USGS</i></td>
          <td style="text-align: right;">
          <div style="color:blue;" class="popup" onclick="myFunction()"><u><strong>Field Team: </strong><i>07/24-2</i></u>
           <span class="popuptext" id="myPopup"><p align="center"><b><u>Team Members</u></b><br/>T. Dawson/CGS<br/>C. DuRoss/USGS<br/>A. Pickering/USGS<br/>E. Spangler/CGS</p></span>
          </div>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="text-align: left;"><strong>Date: </strong><i>July 24, 2019 at 11:47:28 AM PDT</i></td>
          <td style="text-align: right;"><strong>Observer Location: </strong><i>At Site</i></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="text-align: left; padding-bottom: 5px;"><strong>Inferred Origin:</strong><i> Tectonic</i></td>
          <td style="text-align: right; padding-bottom: 5px;"><strong>Inferred Source Event:</strong> <i>M7.1</i></td>
        </tr>
       </table>
       <table>
        <tr>
        	<th>Rupture/Deformation Characteristics</th>
        </tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Rupture Width: </strong><i>30 – 50 m</i></td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Fault Expression: </strong><i>scarp</i></td></tr>
        <tr><td style="padding-bottom: 5px;">
       <dl>
        <dt><u>Description</u></dt>
        <dd style="padding-bottom: 5px;"><i>Rupture continuation from points 038-046. Cm scale down to west scarp with dominantly vertical expression. There is a parallel trace about 30-50 m above (east of) point 047.</i></dd>
       </dl>
      </td></tr>
       </table>
