        <tr><td><strong>Fault Expression: </strong><i>scarp</i></td></tr>
        <tr><td style="padding-bottom: 5px;">
       <dl>
        <dt><u>Description</u></dt>
        <dd style="padding-bottom: 5px;"><i>~25-m wide zone of right-lateral rupture. Excellent projection of sharp boundary between debris flow levee crest and gravel channel. Five measurements summed across multiple faults: 77 +/- 10, 10 +/- 5, 5 +/- 0 , 54 +/- 10, and 8 +/- 0 cm. Total offset is 154 cm with 25 cm uncertainty (sum of individual uncertainties). Vertical separation is approximated (difficult to project). fault azimuth: 330 deg. DuRoss has sketch of feature.</i></dd>
       </dl>
      </td></tr>
       </table>
       <table>
        <tr>
        	<th>Slip/Separation Measurements</th>
