        <dd style="padding-bottom: 5px;"><i>Well-defined mole tracks, fissures, and ground fractures distributed over about 30 m wide zone; Mole tracks, fissures, and ground fractures striking N15E to N30E. Fissures with up to 2.5 cm of subsidence Striking N30E.</i></dd>
       </dl>
