       <dl>
        <dt><u>Description</u></dt>
        <dd style="padding-bottom: 5px;"><i>Bpeo 01. 2 rills and 1 channel on east of fault, only one channel on west. Measured on south margin of channel. 335 cm minimum right-lateral, 400 cm maximum 357.5 +- 37.5. Second cm scale strand 10 m to east, 2 cm right lateral, no vertical. Likely pre-existing topo, dunes on west not on east, may control drainage.</i></dd>
       </dl>
