        <tr><td><strong>Overall Fault Strike: </strong><i>18°</i>, <strong>Dip: </strong><i>70°</i></td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Fault Expression: </strong><i>Scarp</i></td></tr>
        <tr><td style="padding-bottom: 5px;">
       <dl>
        <dt><u>Description</u></dt>
        <dd style="padding-bottom: 5px;"><i>Soil vertically displaced at bedrock fault scarp.  Fault plane exposed at outcrop, fresher toward the base and more degraded night up.  2019 fault is near the top of a 2-3 meter high wedge of blocky rubble and soil.  Origin is uncertain because this could be settling of unconsolidated material at base of scarp. </i></dd>
       </dl>
      </td></tr>
       </table>
