        <tr><td style="padding-bottom: 5px;">
       <dl>
        <dt><u>Description</u></dt>
        <dd style="padding-bottom: 5px;"><i>Sense of slip is opposite of expected left-lateral on northeast trending fault. May be local condition due to rotation of asphalt panel on road base associated with left-lateral deflection of panel to east. cracks on trend in alluvium to northeast.</i></dd>
       </dl>
      </td></tr>
       </table>
